To build th RPM's 
==install==
brew install podman
brew install podman-compose

==Build the RPMs==
cd into jvmctl (the one with the docker-compose.yml file)
podman compose --profile rpm-build-8 up
podman compose --profile rpm-build-9 up
podman compose --profile rpm-build-10 up

They'll appear in RPM/noarch

==Test the RPM install==
podman compose --profile rpm-install-8 up
podman compose --profile rpm-install-9 up
podman compose --profile rpm-install-10 up